    lspuprog:subjectDescription "Introduces experimental design and methodology as applied to psychological research. Students design and conduct simple experiments while learning to control for confounding variables. This course builds directly on the statistics foundation from Psychological Statistics." ;
    lspuprog:sourceDocument "campus_curriculum_clean.md (maintainer-supplied campus curriculum; not from the CHED CMO, Handbook or Citizen's Charter)." .

lspuprog:Subj_BSPsych_LIT1 a lspuprog:Subject ;
