    lspuprog:subjectDescription "Guides students through the early stages of designing a formal psychological research study. Students develop a research proposal grounded in prior coursework on methodology and statistics. This course is the first half of a two-part research sequence." ;
    lspuprog:sourceDocument "campus_curriculum_clean.md (maintainer-supplied campus curriculum; not from the CHED CMO, Handbook or Citizen's Charter)." .

lspuprog:Subj_BSPsych_PSY8 a lspuprog:Subject ;
