    lspuprog:subjectDescription "Examines psychology through an indigenous Filipino lens, exploring culturally-specific psychological concepts and frameworks. Students critically compare Western and Filipino approaches to understanding behavior. The course grounds psychological practice in local cultural context." ;
    lspuprog:sourceDocument "campus_curriculum_clean.md (maintainer-supplied campus curriculum; not from the CHED CMO, Handbook or Citizen's Charter)." .

