    lspu:alternateQuestion "Is there a free clinic or dental service on campus?" ,
        "Where do I go if I feel sick?" ,
        "How do I get medical or dental consultation?" ,
        "Is the clinic free for students?" ,
        "Is there a dentist on campus?" ,
        "Where can I get a medical check-up?" ;
