lspuadm:Doc_CORForGoodMoral a lspu:Document ; rdfs:label "Certificate of Registration" ; lspu:definition "Secured from the Registrar's Office." .
lspuadm:Doc_ORGoodMoralDocStamp a lspu:Document ; rdfs:label "Official Receipt for Good Moral / Documentary Stamp" ; lspu:definition "Secured from the Cashier's Office." .
