lspuadm:Serv_FeedbackAndComplaintsMechanism a lspuadm:Service ;
    rdfs:label "Feedback and Complaints Mechanism" ;
    lspu:definition "How clients send feedback or file a complaint about any LSPU office. Clients accomplish a customer feedback form available at the respective offices (and sign the logbook for complaints) and drop it in the suggestion box within the concerned office. The Public Assistance & Complaint Desk (PACD) Officer opens the suggestion box daily and submits the forms to the Human Resource Management Officer (HRMO), who endorses the feedback/complaint to the concerned office/department/unit for information and immediate action. External channels: ARTA complaints@arta.gov.ph or 1-ARTA (1-2782); PCC 8888; CCB 0908-881-6565 (SMS)." ;
    lspuadm:hasTransactionType lspuadm:TT_Unspecified ;
    lspuadm:whoMayAvail "All clients" ;
    lspuadm:sourceDocument "LSPU Citizen's Charter, 2026 1st Edition (University-Wide)" ;
    lspuadm:sourceSection "Feedback and Complaints Mechanism, p. 92" .

