    lspu:alternateQuestion "What organizations are in CCS?" ,
        "Which college offers BS Information Technology?" ;
    lspu:definition "The College of Computer Studies (CCS) offers 4 programs: BS Computer Science major in Intelligent Systems, and BS Information Technology majors in Animation and Motion Graphics, Web and Mobile Application Development, and Service Management Program. CCS gives priority to STEM and ICT/ICTS strand applicants." ;
